# Reviewed, deliberate acceptances for trivy misconfiguration checks — the
# same philosophy as tools/audit-baseline.json: known, reasoned, tracked.
# Rationale per group below; recorded in PROGRESS.md ("2026-10-03 — CI
# green-up") and in inline # trivy:ignore comments where the finding has a
# line to attach to.
#
# Deliberate-root service images (see the per-file trivy:ignore comments):
# the official nginx entrypoint needs root for envsubst/htpasswd before
# dropping to the nginx user; the viewer/backup/mock-worker images write to
# root-owned state paths on purpose.
AVD-DS-0002
#
# Operator ClusterRole holds get-only access to the single credential Secret
# it reconciles; without it the operator cannot function (KSV-0041).
AVD-KSV-0041
#
# Blueprint-only cloud Terraform (deploy/terraform/{aws,azure,gcp,digitalocean}):
# none of it is deployed — production is the VPS compose stack, and the
# multi-region/geodns work is design-only (PROGRESS.md). Reviewed 2026-10-03;
# re-scope these checks the moment a cloud deployment becomes real.
AVD-AWS-0039
AVD-AWS-0040
AVD-AWS-0041
AVD-AWS-0164
AVD-AZU-0041
AVD-AZU-0042
AVD-DIG-0008
AVD-GCP-0048
AVD-GCP-0061
